usage: main.py [-h] --pipeline {fp32,int16} --encoder ENCODER
               --predictor PREDICTOR --decoder DECODER --manifest MANIFEST
               --vocab VOCAB --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR [--max-utts MAX_UTTS]
               [--threads THREADS]

Evaluate explicit prepared features with CPU FP32 or HMCT simulated models.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --pipeline {fp32,int16}
  --encoder, --enc ENCODER
  --predictor, --pred PREDICTOR
  --decoder, --dec DECODER
  --manifest MANIFEST
  --vocab VOCAB
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
  --max-utts MAX_UTTS   select a prefix; 0 means all
  --threads THREADS     FP32 ORT intra-op threads; not an HMCT setting
